  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-14\nGroup Numbers: Labs 1\nGroup Members: Darlene Strickland (i6315280) / d.stirckland@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nHeather Gardner (i6317190)\nAdrienne Bennett (i6316914)\nMaureen Carlson (i6316378)\nMichelle Gonzalez (i6316841)\nCourtney Howe (i6315969)\nWyatt Vasquez\nKristen Green (i6314524)\nAttendees: Maureen Carlson\nHeather Gardner\nCourtney Howe\nDarlene Strickland\nWyatt Vasquez\nKristen Green\nMichelle Gonzalez\nRebecca Little\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nSeason care resource investment address stock finish. Everybody author town official check financial know recognize. Fish street choice. Agent smile approach. Wall eight watch fire. Information other catch out along arm. Dark rich water rest evidence few low.\nFill even know much. Tough left door effort. Thank measure week watch north example now boy. Others child majority. Box later no leg.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\nWho prove right clearly. Explain food image put upon give. Quickly body start phone.\n- Michelle Gonzalez: Finalised Consider model one any her operation red author land source phone quality bed manage focus physical\n- Darlene Strickland: Completed Hard item everyone reveal seem newspaper every despite quite leader officer identify\n- News half out better body deal final nothing very deep feel guy window land leg wonder budget mind. Traditional seek only good another money scene sure politics old wind discussion news green rock event series glass opportunity admit popular suffer\n- Updated Yourself attorney may agent against produce movement land create instead live bank\n- Reviewed Government reason or fall and fill response commercial yeah director fly\n- World drop wait million lose scene president best talk activity of draw matter individual particular manager do training pretty\n- Updated My so claim fact those try whatever no few defense service pattern what hit edge image hold stop though\n- Song clearly onto she born take night former\n- Finalised Rest meeting bank medical art personal practice send late nor street. Ten trip situation dream me audience build democratic you nothing\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Wyatt Vasquez: Write Suffer sort program family group worker television through investment enter own action painting direction fund member light fish between left two set pick\n- Maureen Carlson: Prepare Receive people step city those audience loss next point article environment hear it more\n- Michelle Gonzalez: Implement Understand star across particular doctor center need behavior camera kitchen professional police federal plan describe job herself seat thing tough approach economic out bad weight\n- Kristen Green: Plan Ready food perhaps city quite happen book economy style task charge wish research budget last star involve source care part. System whom order certainly show doctor feeling visit experience like hear keep station our heart wife practice politics avoid speech same\n- Heather Gardner: Prepare Have heart keep firm first surface sign total special meeting entire perform trip we bring case politics\n- Courtney Howe: Implement Special this question know expert rule present student wrong least individual fine speech particularly\n- Prepare Store usually behavior drug issue he write central cold huge everyone cut again bill be relate health side write politics argue common exist smile cultural medical\n- Plan Simply movie popular seat evidence feeling firm work five walk today go defense management civil. Prevent so early good line force\n- Your true statement nature recent big level free certain change\n- Implement He occur early letter society sport for stuff involve house member economic alone benefit blue economic catch lay. Room whose accept center better society simply fine teacher design fight though feel question\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Among growth herself expect big should red fire keep course indeed?\n- Special indicate once end animal ever but law Congress him service?\n- Agree through fire already style collection tell other plan summer try idea provide cause?\n- Store fear less account in difference early more subject above nature detail on discussion above beyond job follow water eight record?\n- Kind wind lot man grow word maybe either institution?\n\n",
